    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, really? i mean, i get migraines all the time and sometimes i get blurry vision or weird tingles. i feel like i'm just overreacting because i'm stressed. could it just be that my usual migraine is just hitting harder this time? i really don't want to go to the ER if i can avoid it, it's so expensive and always a huge hassle.",
